{"v":1,"seq":27,"kind":"message","text":"The targeted cache tests and race run passed. Source inspection shows two remaining paths where the helper can duplicate work: a waiter discards its successful retry instead of caching it, and capacity eviction can remove an entry while its computation is still running. I couldn’t run added probes because the sandbox refused a new Go build directory; I’ll distinguish those source findings from test results."}
